194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 154 0 R
/E (BuildTrack is a modern construction project management and site monitoring platform developed as part of the Infosys Springboard internship by Team 2. In typical civil infrastructure and commercial construction environments, site supervisors, project managers, contractors, and clients often face operational fragmentation due to disparate communication channels, lagging spreadsheets, and manual field paper logs. BuildTrack addresses these operational bottlenecks by bringing project activities, human capital, physical machinery, raw materials, procurement schedules, cost management, dynamic progress calculations, real-time alerts, executive dashboards, and exportable audit documentation into one unified digital system.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
